{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"storage","type":"text","text":"## storage 数据层\n\nPrisma + SQLite\n\n核心表：\n- User\n- Book\n- Character\n- Location\n- Item\n- CharacterReview\n- ExtractionSession\n- Task\n- 🆕 NoiseOverride\n- 🆕 EntityImage","x":-620,"y":640,"width":420,"height":310},
		{"id":"import","type":"text","text":"## import 增强导入\n\nparseTxtEnhanced\n\n1. preprocess：文本归一化/去噪\n2. splitChaptersStructured：章节切分与结构化\n3. prescanEntities：实体预扫\n\n🆕 encoding.ts：编码检测\n🆕 sanitizer.ts：文本净化\n🆕 配合 NoiseOverride 覆盖","x":460,"y":-665,"width":420,"height":290},
		{"id":"chapter_reader","type":"text","text":"## 🆕 Chapter Reader 章节阅读\n\n前端组件：\n- ChapterReader.tsx\n\n功能：\n- 原文章节浏览\n- 章节切分可视化\n- 与实体抽取结果对照\n- 噪声行高亮显示","x":-1840,"y":-80,"width":340,"height":380},
		{"id":"web","type":"text","text":"## web 前端\n\n- UploadPage：上传 TXT、启动提取\n- LibraryPage：书库列表\n- ReviewPage：人工审核角色/地点/物品\n- 🆕 ChaptersPage：原文章节阅读\n- 🆕 StoriesPage：故事弧线管理\n- 🆕 DirectorPage：导演代理编排\n- SettingsPage：LLM 配置\n- ExportPage：导出","x":-1240,"y":-100,"width":340,"height":310},
		{"id":"auth","type":"text","text":"## 🆕 auth 认证系统\n\nJWT 令牌认证\n\n功能：\n- 用户注册/登录\n- 默认本地账号自动登录\n- token 校验 /auth/me\n- 路由守卫 RequireAuth\n- 密码哈希存储\n\n前端：\n- authStore（Zustand）\n- bootstrapping 登录态检测\n- AuthPage 登录页","x":-1240,"y":-665,"width":340,"height":380},
		{"id":"image_gen","type":"text","text":"## 🆕 图片生成\n\nEntityImage + image-custom provider\n\n功能：\n- 一键生成实体立绘/场景图\n- 用户上传图片\n- isPrimary 标记主图\n- 多年龄段角色图（stage 字段）\n- 支持 character / item / location\n- aspectRatio 记录比例\n- source: generated | uploaded\n\n前端：images API + 图片组件","x":-1330,"y":300,"width":340,"height":320},
		{"id":"scheduler","type":"text","text":"## scheduler 调度层\n\nTaskDispatcher + Queue\n\n阶段顺序：\n1. extractor\n2. validator\n3. entity-resolution\n4. reviewer\n\n职责：创建任务、重试、事件通知、阶段完成后传递 payload、最终更新 Book 状态。\n\n🆕 eventBus 事件总线","x":30,"y":-195,"width":430,"height":375},
		{"id":"resolution","type":"text","text":"## Stage 3: Entity Resolution\n\nentity-resolution 模块\n\n职责：\n- 同名合并\n- 中文姓名归一\n- 安全别名匹配\n- 规范名选择\n- 清洗泛称/集体称谓\n\n输出：合并后的角色列表 + merged 数量\n\n🆕 merger.ts：合并逻辑\n🆕 relationship/：关系检测","x":2040,"y":300,"width":440,"height":420},
		{"id":"director_ui","type":"text","text":"## 🆕 Director 导演页面\n\nDirectorPage + StoriesPage\n\n功能：\n- 故事弧线浏览\n- 边界审阅（BoundaryReviewPage）\n- 故事资产管理（StoryAssetsPage）\n- 剧集规划（EpisodesPage）\n- 导演代理编排\n- 剧本审阅结果\n- 视频提示词预览\n- PromptCopyBlock 一键复制","x":10,"y":1320,"width":340,"height":440},
		{"id":"review_ui","type":"text","text":"## 人工审核 UI\n\nReviewPage → EntityReviewPage\n\n功能：\n- 角色/地点/物品 Tab\n- PENDING / APPROVED / REJECTED 过滤\n- 单个通过/拒绝/编辑\n- 批量通过/拒绝\n- 查看原文内容\n- 🆕 ConfidenceBar 置信度条\n- 🆕 EntityDetailPanel 详情面板\n- 🆕 EntityArtifactsSection 产物展示\n- 🆕 实体图片生成/上传","x":-620,"y":1320,"width":420,"height":340},
		{"id":"story_arcs","type":"text","text":"## story-arcs 故事资产\n\n从章节和预扫结果构建：\n- story segments\n- narrative events\n- characters in story\n- scenes\n- props\n- episode plan\n- storyboard/video prompt pack\n\n🆕 director-agent.ts：导演代理\n🆕 script-reviewer.ts：剧本审阅\n🆕 video-prompt-agent.ts：视频提示词\n🆕 chapter-segments.ts：章节分段\n🆕 story-asset-io.ts：资产读写\n🆕 story-asset-utils.ts：工具函数","x":600,"y":1280,"width":460,"height":380},
		{"id":"persist","type":"text","text":"## Dispatcher 入库\n\n在进入 Reviewer 前持久化：\n\n- Character\n- Location\n- Item\n\n默认 status = PENDING\n\n地点/物品保存重要度字段：importanceScore、tier、storyScore、productionScore、pillar*、mentionCount、chapterAppearances。\n\n🆕 EntityImage 图片记录","x":880,"y":795,"width":470,"height":330},
		{"id":"exporters","type":"text","text":"## exporters 导出\n\n支持格式：\n- JSON\n- Markdown\n- CSV\n\n当前 API 主要导出 characters。\n\n🆕 factory.ts：导出器工厂\n🆕 base.ts：基类抽象","x":-1410,"y":1320,"width":340,"height":360},
		{"id":"relationship","type":"text","text":"## 🆕 relationship 关系检测\n\nentity-resolution/relationship/\n\n功能：\n- 角色间关系发现\n- 关系类型推断\n- 关系强度评估\n- 与 story-arcs 联动\n\ndetectors/：\n- 同名检测\n- 别名检测\n- 泛称检测","x":1640,"y":1400,"width":400,"height":260},
		{"id":"reviewer","type":"text","text":"## Stage 4: Reviewer\n\n当前逻辑：\n- 实体已经写入 DB\n- 标记为等待人工审核\n- 返回 Characters ready for human review\n\n随后：\n- 写 pipeline final summary\n- Book.status = EXTRACTED\n- eventBus 发 completed","x":-15,"y":910,"width":390,"height":370},
		{"id":"scripts","type":"text","text":"## 脚本入口\n\n- run_producer.mjs：走 Producer/调度管线\n- run-extract.ts：直接读文本、调用 LLM 抽取、写 output/entities\n- 🆕 test.mjs：管线验证脚本\n- 🆕 check-workspace-deps.mjs：依赖检查","x":-310,"y":-625,"width":340,"height":250},
		{"id":"output","type":"text","text":"## 文件输出\n\n- .intermediate/{run}/prescan：预扫中间文件\n- output/{book-run}/：最终摘要和故事资产\n- output/{book-run}/entities：characters/items/locations/summary\n\n🆕 storage/uploads/：上传文件存储\n🆕 storage/uploads/images/：实体图片存储","x":30,"y":535,"width":430,"height":260},
		{"id":"artifacts","type":"text","text":"## 🆕 artifacts 抽取产物\n\nartifacts.service.ts\n\n功能：\n- 管理每次抽取产生的中间产物\n- 关联 ExtractionSession\n- 支持产物浏览和下载\n- 产物类型：\n  - 预扫结果\n  - LLM 原始输出\n  - 校验报告\n  - 消歧日志\n  - 最终摘要","x":-620,"y":225,"width":420,"height":310},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Entity 功能模块总览\n\n小说 TXT → 章节解析 → 实体预扫 → LLM 抽取 → 校验/消歧 → 入库 → 人工审核/导出\n\n🆕 = 相比原始 canvas 新增模块","x":-1540,"y":-1340,"width":760,"height":200},
		{"id":"noise_override","type":"text","text":"## 🆕 NoiseOverride 噪声覆盖\n\ntext cleaning 人工覆盖\n\n功能：\n- 标记某行被「找回」（不删除）\n- lineNum 为规范化后文本行号\n- bookId + lineNum 唯一约束\n- 前端可逐行 toggle\n- 配合 preprocess 模块使用\n\n解决：自动清洗误删正文的问题","x":-840,"y":-945,"width":340,"height":280},
		{"id":"extractor_stage","type":"text","text":"## Stage 1: Extractor\n\n输入：Book.filePath\n\n处理：\n- 读取小说文本\n- 调用 parseTxtEnhanced\n- LLM 按 30 章/批抽取角色/地点/物品\n- 角色与预扫结果融合\n- 过滤 0 提及 + 0 对白的幻觉角色\n- 地点/物品用预扫补充提及数、章节覆盖、重要度\n- 调用 story-arcs 生成故事资产\n\n🆕 character-signals.ts：角色信号检测\n🆕 coreference/：共指消解","x":620,"y":-195,"width":520,"height":420},
		{"id":"prescan","type":"text","text":"## entity-prescan 实体预扫\n\n对象：人物、地点、物品、事件\n\n流程：\n- 正则扫描（patterns.ts）\n- 全文角色发现（role-discovery.ts）\n- 可选 LLM 补全（llm-completion.ts）\n- 别名规范化\n- 置信度过滤（confidence.ts）\n- 重要度评分（importance.ts + scoring.ts）\n- 分层输出 core/supporting/candidate/archive\n- 🆕 selection.ts：分层选择策略\n- 🆕 writer.ts：结果写入","x":1325,"y":-625,"width":460,"height":370},
		{"id":"llm_prompts","type":"text","text":"## llm + prompts\n\nLLM provider 抽象：\n- custom（自定义端点）\n- mock（测试用）\n- 🆕 image-custom（图片生成）\n\n🆕 configStore.ts：配置持久化\n🆕 keyVault.ts：密钥管理\n🆕 errors.ts：错误处理\n\nprompts：\n- 角色/实体抽取\n- 校验\n- 实体消歧\n- 故事弧线","x":1660,"y":10,"width":360,"height":340},
		{"id":"validator","type":"text","text":"## Stage 2: Validator\n\nvalidators 模块\n\n职责：\n- validateCharacters\n- validateEntityBatch\n- 低置信度过滤\n- 缺字段检查\n- 非法名称检查\n- 实体去重/别名冲突检查\n\n🆕 confidence.ts：置信度计算\n🆕 detectors/：多种检测器","x":1115,"y":485,"width":420,"height":310},
		{"id":"api","type":"text","text":"## api 后端\n\nFastify 服务\n\n- /books：上传、列表、内容、删除\n- /books/:id/extract：启动/状态\n- /characters、/locations、/items：实体审核更新\n- /export/:bookId：导出\n- /health/llm：LLM 状态与配置\n- 🆕 /auth：认证路由\n- 🆕 /images：实体图片管理\n- 🆕 /artifacts：抽取产物管理\n- 🆕 /stories：故事弧线路由\n- 🆕 /director：导演代理路由","x":-620,"y":-290,"width":420,"height":380}
	],
